<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to spend HUF 5 to 8 bln on industry parks.</title>
<headline>Hungary to spend HUF 5 to 8 bln on industry parks.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will spend five to eight billion forints on industrial park projects over the next five years, a government official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Industry and Trade Ministry will establish tender criteria as only qualified 'industry park' projects would benefit from the advantages,&quot; government spokesman Elemer Kiss told a news conference following the weekly cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>The first tender will be announced by March 31, 1997. Further tenders will be published annually thereafter, a government press release said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327 4040</p>
